{"type": "say", "text": "Thank you all for those important findings. Let me summarize where we stand before we proceed. Mei, thank you for disclosing the $1,200,000 equity injection commitment — that's a meaningful credit enhancement I'll factor in. Rafael, the intercreditor consent requirement is a clear prerequisite; we cannot include the equipment collateral release in final terms until the senior lender's written consent is obtained. Nadia, the weekly borrowing-base certificate for receivables is noted and will be a condition of any extension, and the monitoring schedule will need to be updated before we finalize. Jonas, I appreciate you flagging that the covenant testing file hasn't been circulated yet. However, per our standard workout process, I need your covenant-testing findings and the applicable workout policy citation formally presented and recorded in the minutes before I can determine the appropriate workout treatment and record final terms. As we all know, the workout treatment depends on the current covenant test result and the supporting policy — so I cannot finalize this proposal from the borrower's requested terms alone. Jonas, please go ahead and present your full covenant-testing findings and policy citation for the record now, assuming the testing file can be referenced. Once I have that, I'll be in a position to make the binding decision on restructuring terms."}
```

